'''Rampart's Quarry''' is a [[Location]] in the [[Dwarven Mines]] and a connecting point between many locations.

== Purpose ==
'''Rampart's Quarry''' serves as a place for players to go [[Mining]]. There is also a chance for [[Fallen Star]]s and [[Goblin Raid]]s to appear.

